<title>UK: OFT sets routine review of Lowndes Lambert buy.</title>
<headline>OFT sets routine review of Lowndes Lambert buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said on Tuesday that it was making a preliminary consideration of whether to start a mergers investigation into the proposed acquisition of insurance broker Fenchurch Plc by its fellow sector firm Lowndes Lambert Group Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>In a statement the OFT said it was inviting comments from interested parties about any competition implications to be received by February 4.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
